{"날짜": "2026-09-11", "시험지명": "초당고_고1_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260911-CL-G1A-17ee4dfe", "문항": {"5": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">삼각형 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>의 무게중심의 좌표가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>이고 변 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>의 중점의 좌표가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>일 때, 꼭짓점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow></math>의 좌표를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>라 하자. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>의 값은? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>는 상수이다.)</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></math></span><span clas