/msub><mo>&#x0222A;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>의 값은?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 8번 · 배수·약수와 방정식의 해집합"}, "15": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>이 나타내는 도형이 그림과 같을 때, 방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>이 나타내는 도형은?</p><p></p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><div class=\"pcs c2 pic\"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 15번 · 방정식 f(x, y)=0이 나타내는 도형의 이동"}, "16": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">그림과 같이 반지름의 길이가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math>인 구 모양의 조형물이 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow></math>에서 지면과 만난다. 점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow></math>로부터 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math>만큼 떨어진 지점에 조명을 설치하여 비출 때, 이 조형물이 조명을 받는 부분의 최대 높이는? (단, 조명의 크기는 생각하지 않는다.)</p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 16번 · 원의 접선의 방정식: 원 밖의 점이 주어질 때"}, "17": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">그림과 같이 좌표평면 위에 세 점</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math></p><p>이 있다. 선분 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>:</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>로 내분하는 점을 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mrow></math>라 할 때, 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>가 삼각형 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>의 넓이를 이등분한다. 양수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>의 값은? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mrow></math>는 원점이다.)</p><div class=\"fig\"><span class=\"missing\">[그림은 시험지에서]</span></div><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 17번 · 도형의 넓이를 이등분하는 직선"}}}